Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在你打字之前，我们的分诊页显示一行衬线字的问候\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before you type, our triage page shows a serif greeting asking where it hurts,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.63,0:00:09.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,问你哪里不舒服；屏幕中间是输入框，下面是一排建议\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an input box in the middle of the screen, and a row of suggestions under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.52,0:00:11.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你觉得它像 Claude 的 app，那就对了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If that reminds you of Claude's app, it should.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.27,0:00:15.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是你要求一比一照抄的，agent 把它做了出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You asked for a one-to-one copy, and the agent built it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.77,0:00:18.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照抄，不正是做产品应该避免的吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Isn't copying exactly what a product should avoid?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:20.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但这一次，照抄就是计划\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here it was the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:23.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,抄了什么、拒绝了什么、我们加了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What was copied, what was refused, what we added,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:26.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有什么是还没人做过的：这就是这一集\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and what nobody has built yet: that is this episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:29.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先认识各个部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, the parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:33.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,几乎每个聊天 app 都有同样这几样，设计师给它们都起了名字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Almost every chat app has the same ones, and designers have names for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.07,0:00:37.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,空状态，也就是首屏，是发第一条消息之前的页面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The empty state is the page before the first message.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:41.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,建议是现成的问题；我们的建议点开是演示回放\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Suggestion chips are ready-made questions; ours start demo replays.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:44.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入框就是你打字的地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The composer is the input box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:49.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它里面有模型菜单和发送键；等回答的时候，发送键会变成停止键\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside it sit a model menu and the send key, which turns into a stop key while you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:53.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,发出去以后，你的话放在右边的气泡里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Once you send, your words sit in a bubble on the right,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.28,0:00:55.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回答整宽显示，不加框\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the answer runs full width without a box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:01:00.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每条回答下面是一排操作按钮：复制；最新的一条还有重新回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Under each answer is an action row: copy, and under the latest one, retry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.31,0:01:04.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,往上翻，会出现一个圆形按钮，带你回到最下面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Scroll up, and a round button appears to take you back to the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:08.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入框下面还有一行小字：免责声明\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And under the input, one line of fine print: the disclaimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.37,0:01:13.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,团队里没有设计师\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The team has no designer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.39,0:01:17.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你要求这一页照着 Claude 的聊天界面一比一地做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You asked for the page to follow Claude's chat, one to one,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.14,0:01:21.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,当天夜里，agent 把理由写成了决策 0006\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and that night the agent wrote the reasons down as decision six,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:22.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并和另外两个方案做了比较\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}against two other options.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:28.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自己设计一套风格：没有参考，大概率做得普通，还容易返工\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Invent our own style: without references, probably ordinary, and likely to be redone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.73,0:01:30.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从几个 app 里各取所长\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Take the best parts of several apps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.01,0:01:34.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,或者照抄一个成熟的 app，一比一，不混搭\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Or copy one mature app exactly, with no mixing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:39.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先停一下：为什么照抄一个产品，会比从几个产品里各取所长更好？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Before the answer: why would copying one product beat picking the best parts of several?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:48.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为不同产品的部件彼此不一致：间距、颜色、按钮的行为都不一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Because parts from different products disagree: spacing, colours, how a button behaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:50.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,拼接的地方会露出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The seams show,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:55.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,决策记录还指出了第二个代价：你再也说不清每个决定是从哪来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the decision record names a second cost: you can no longer say where each choice came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.39,0:01:59.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个成熟的参考，会用同一种方式回答每个小问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One mature reference answers every small question the same way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:02:03.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以用最少的设计判断，就能得到一个不难看、不出错的页面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the fewest design calls give a page that is neither ugly nor wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.99,0:02:05.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这对用的人也有好处\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It also helps the people using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:11.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,设计师把它叫作雅各布定律：用户大部分时间都在别的网站上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Designers call it Jakob's law: users spend most of their time on other sites,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:13.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以他们希望你的网站也照同样的方式工作\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so they prefer yours to work the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.91,0:02:18.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,agent 提议的规则是：每个界面只照抄一个参考\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The rule the agent proposed: every screen copies exactly one reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.92,0:02:23.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,聊天页的参考，就是团队每个人每天都在用的 Claude 的 app\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}For the chat page, that is Claude's app, which everyone on the team uses every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:26.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来看抄了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is what was copied.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:30.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一栏，最宽 768 像素\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One column, at most 768 pixels wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:33.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的消息放在右边一个米灰色的气泡里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your message in a beige bubble on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:36.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回答用衬线字，整宽，不加框\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The answer in serif type, full width, no frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:40.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,输入框：一个白色的圆角框，会随着你打字长高\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The composer: a white rounded box that grows as you type.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.50,0:02:44.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,沿着它的下边，在 Claude 放附件和工具的位置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Along its bottom edge, where Claude keeps attachments and tools,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:49.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们放了三个自己的下拉菜单：谁在问、保险，以及你在哪里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}we put three drop-downs of our own: who is asking, insurance, and where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:54.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,右边是模型菜单，Terra，思考强度中，紧挨着陶土橙的发送键\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On the right, the model menu, Terra at medium effort, next to the terracotta send key,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:58.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Claude 的帮助文档里，它的模型菜单也在这个位置\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the same spot where Claude's help page puts its own model menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.07,0:03:02.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里有两个决定是你做的：要不要照抄 Claude 的聊天页\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two choices here were yours: copy Claude's chat page at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.98,0:03:07.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及要不要连它温暖的配色和衬线字一起抄，而不只是版式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and copy its warm colours and serif type too, not only the layout.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:12.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些只用在这一页；网站的其他页面仍然用中性的过渡主题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They stay inside this one page; the rest of the site keeps its neutral theme.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.57,0:03:15.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没抄的部分，每一样都有理由\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What was not copied, each for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.21,0:03:19.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Claude 的标志、名字和私有字体：它们不属于我们\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Claude's logo, name and private fonts: they aren't ours,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.57,0:03:25.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Claude 思考时显示它的标志，我们显示一个小圆点，字体用开源的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so where Claude shows its logo while it thinks, ours shows a small dot, and the fonts are open ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:28.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,侧栏、对话历史、附件和工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The sidebar, chat history, attachments and tools:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:33.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们没有账号、没有存储，这个原型也不需要\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}we have no accounts and no storage, and the prototype doesn't need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.83,0:03:38.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有第二集讲过的两样：推理原文，以及一边写一边流出来的文字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the two from episode two: the raw reasoning, and words streaming as they are written.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.08,0:03:41.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的回答要先通过检查器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our answers pass the checker first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.47,0:03:44.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再来一个更难的问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now a harder question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.22,0:03:48.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一位在中国的家长，打开这个页面，想了解在波士顿的孩子的情况\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A parent in China opens this page about their child in Boston.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.48,0:03:50.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,他需要什么，是学生本人不需要的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What do they need that the student doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:03:58.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先从 911 说起\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Start with 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,家长在中国打不了 911\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A parent can't dial it from China.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:04.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以页面上每一句固定的话，对家长都会改写\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So every fixed line on the page changes for parents:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.74,0:04:10.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不是让你打 911，而是请孩子或身边的人在当地打 911\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}instead of call 911, it asks the child or someone nearby to call 911 locally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:14.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,电话号码前面加上国家码 1，并注明从中国拨打\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Phone numbers get a plus one and the words dial from China.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.85,0:04:20.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,急救和危机热线干脆不做拨号链接，只写：请当地的人来打\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Emergency and crisis numbers get no dial link at all, only: ask someone there to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有些新增是给所有人的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Some additions are for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:26.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,紧急情况下，红框的「现在就做」排在最前\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In an emergency, a red do-this-now block comes first,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:29.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,立刻全部显示，读屏软件会马上念出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}appears at once, and is read aloud by screen readers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.30,0:04:33.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,顶栏一直有一个紧急情况的入口\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An emergency link sits in the top bar at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.91,0:04:36.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,演示和估算都标着模拟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Demos and estimates are labelled simulated,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:42.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,学生把回答复制给家长时，标注也一起带走：不是诊断\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and when a student copies an answer for a parent, the label goes with it: not a diagnosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.58,0:04:46.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一些是给用不同方式使用页面的人\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And some are for people who use the page differently:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:49.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,读屏软件可以按隐藏的标题一轮一轮地跳\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}hidden headings a screen reader can jump between,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:53.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,依据链接至少 24 像素高，手指点得准\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}source links at least 24 pixels tall so a finger can hit them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.37,0:04:54.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,放大到 400% 时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and at 400 percent zoom,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.95,0:04:58.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,页面从顶上开始，紧急情况的入口就在眼前\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a page that opens at the top with the emergency link in view.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:01.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,agent 是怎么把它做出来的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}How did the agent build it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:07.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,周三凌晨 1 点 59 分，波士顿时间，它先把决策写了下来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On Wednesday at one fifty-nine in the morning, Boston time, it wrote the decision down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.72,0:05:12.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,17 分钟后，它提交了重做好的页面：27 个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Seventeen minutes later it committed the rebuilt page: 27 files.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:14.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,又过了 6 分钟，端到端测试也有了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Six minutes after that, end-to-end tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:16.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来是一轮又一轮的审查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then came the reviews.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一次独立的视觉审查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An independent visual review.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.06,0:05:23.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你要的流式输出，做成了只流进度，以及对它的审查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Streaming, which you had asked for, built as progress only, and a review of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.65,0:05:26.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二轮视觉审查，带来了 Claude 的手机版排版\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A second visual review, which brought Claude's phone layout
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:30.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及你刚才看到的大部分家长用语和无障碍改动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and much of the parent wording and accessibility you just saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:33.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后是从五个角度做的终审\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And a final review from five angles:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.05,0:05:37.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,约 30 个问题，在几条并行的分支上修好，然后又检查了一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}about 30 problems, fixed on parallel branches, then checked once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.05,0:05:39.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个 bug 能说明这件事为什么难\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One bug shows why this is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.23,0:05:44.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,发送和停止共用一个按钮：等回答的时候，发送变成停止\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Send and stop share one button: while you wait, send turns into stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.71,0:05:46.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,点停止，等待结束\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Click stop, the wait ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.24,0:05:49.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就在同一次点击里，按钮又变回了发送\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and in that same click the button turns back into send,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:51.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,于是输入框里的内容被发了出去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so whatever was in the box went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:55.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在演示回放里，发出去的正是你刚刚停掉的那句话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In a demo replay, that was the very message you had just stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:57.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修复只有一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix was one line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:06:03.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,后来 Bugbot 又发现了它的镜像：双击发送，第二下点到了停止上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then Bugbot found the mirror image: double-click send, and the second click lands on stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:07.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,又是一行修复：忽略双击的第二下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Another one-line fix: ignore the second click of a double-click.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:10.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照抄一个按钮的样子，并不等于照抄了它的行为\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Copying how a button looks does not copy how it behaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.17,0:06:14.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,大的聊天 app 有哪些我们没有的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What do the big chat apps have that we don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.60,0:06:21.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对话历史和项目、上传文件、语音、放文档和代码的侧边面板\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Conversation history and projects, file uploads, voice, a side panel for documents and code,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:22.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有跨对话的记忆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and memory across chats.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:27.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们大多需要账号和存储，而这个原型没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Most of them need accounts and storage, which this prototype doesn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:29.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些里面，语音可能对这里最重要\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Of these, voice may matter most here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:33.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,着急的家长也许宁愿说话而不是打字；历史和记忆意味着要\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for a worried parent who would rather speak than type;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.09,0:06:38.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,保存健康相关的对话，这要先做隐私上的决定\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}history and memory would mean keeping health conversations, which needs a privacy decision first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.22,0:06:40.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那只有我们能做的是什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And what could only we build?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:45.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个回答，两种读者：学生版和家长版并排放\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One answer for two readers, the student's and the parent's, side by side;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.64,0:06:49.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每条回答里已经有一段折叠起来的给家长的摘要，这就是雏形\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}every answer already carries a folded summary for parents, the seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.22,0:06:54.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一张学生发回家的摘要卡片；复制给家长已经是第一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A summary card the student sends home; copy for parent is already a first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.11,0:07:00.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有直接帮你预约：回答里已经写好了要说的英文句子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And a hand-off to booking: the answer already writes the English sentences to say;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:03.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,页面可以直接打电话，或者帮你填表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the page could place the call, or fill in the form.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.35,0:07:06.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有等你决定的：一共十几项\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And what waits for you: a dozen open items.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:08.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,决策 0006 仍然是提议\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Decision six is still a proposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.78,0:07:12.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,agent 当晚在无人值守时补充的部分也是\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and so is what the agent added to it that night, unattended:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.75,0:07:16.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只流进度的流式输出、模型菜单和重新回答\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}progress-only streaming, the model menu and retry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:18.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有两个选择需要你点头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two more choices need your yes:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:23.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,停掉的那句话不再收回，而是和你的下一句一起发出去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a stopped message is no longer taken back but goes out with your next one,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:25.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,家长看到的危机热线没有拨号链接\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and parents get no dial link for crisis lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:30.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以：每个界面只照抄一个参考，一比一\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So: one reference per screen, copied exactly,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:34.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这样每个小选择都有答案，页面也让人觉得熟悉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so every small choice has an answer and the page feels familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.79,0:07:38.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Claude 的版式、输入框和配色，只用在这一页\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Claude's layout, composer and colours, kept to this page.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.46,0:07:43.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不抄它的标志、历史、推理原文和逐字流式输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Not its logo, its history, its raw thoughts or its word-by-word streaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:47.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再加上只有一个面向两类读者的医疗页面才需要的东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Plus what only a medical page for two audiences needs:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:50.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,紧急情况放最前、在中国的家长也能照着做的说法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}emergency first, wording a parent in China can act on,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.75,0:07:53.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及跟着复制走的标注\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and labels that travel with copied text.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:07:55.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,三个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:57.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么照抄一个产品，而不是几个？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why copy one product instead of several?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:08:01.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么家长版的页面要请别人去打 911？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why does the parent's page ask someone else to call 911?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:04.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是什么让发送键两次变成了 bug？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And what turned the send key into a bug, twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:10.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下一集讲那两天本身\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next time: the two days themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:13.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,agent 一个小时一个小时都做了什么，又花了多少钱\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What the agents did, hour by hour, and what it cost.
